p.src:
Multiplication by $g^{rs}$ isolates the connection: $\boxed{
 \Gamma^r{}_{mn}
 =\frac12 g^{rs}
 \left(
 \partial_mg_{sn}
 +\partial_ng_{sm}
 -\partial_sg_{mn}
 \right)}$ Thus the Levi-Civita connection is built from the metric and its first derivatives. This is the promised reason that the Christoffel symbols vanish at the center of normal coordinates.

