 R_{srn}{}^t
={}&
 \partial_r\Gamma^t{}_{sn}
 -\partial_s\Gamma^t{}_{rn}\\
&+\Gamma^p{}_{sn}\Gamma^t{}_{pr}
 -\Gamma^p{}_{rn}\Gamma^t{}_{ps}.
\end{split}$ Other texts may reverse the sign or arrange the indices differently; the convention is fixed by writing both [eq:l3-riemann-commutator] and [eq:l3-riemann].

